Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.41,0:19:40.54,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.71,0:19:43.39,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,治癒的力量 飛揚起來！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.56,0:19:48.89,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,薩拉拉隊長！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.86,0:19:53.97,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託了 睜開眼睛！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.11,0:19:56.40,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嘻嘻...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.56,0:19:57.78,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不許動！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.08,0:20:01.27,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你要敢動一絲...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.80,0:20:03.97,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對饒不了你！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.54,0:20:10.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,沒問題的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.07,0:20:12.23,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.94,0:20:16.45,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,只要還有人相信著 盼望著
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.62,0:20:18.36,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,就能夠無數次站起來
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.47,0:20:22.18,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,這才是英雄啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.72,0:20:27.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...金句良言啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.92,0:20:32.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又見面了 英雄少女
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.77,0:20:40.99,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,颯拉拉隊長... 我好想你...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.17,0:20:45.48,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能 不可理喻 沒道理的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.64,0:20:46.86,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.65,0:20:49.86,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.04,0:20:51.89,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,虛... 虛蜢蜢！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.78,0:21:02.84,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你... 你們現在不了結我 我還會再來的！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.37,0:21:05.96,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我還會來激怒你的！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.13,0:21:09.19,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣都無所謂嗎 晴雯麗！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.89,0:21:12.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,無所謂
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.63,0:21:14.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不管你耍什麼花招 我都不會再重蹈覆轍
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.72,0:21:17.98,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我會變得更強的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.56,0:21:27.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure 堅強又溫柔的孩子們
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.28,0:21:31.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你教導出來的吧？由由博士
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.69,0:21:36.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不... 不如說我反而受教了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.06,0:21:39.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我還不成熟
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.43,0:21:43.15,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 既然不成熟那就該繼續前進
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.58,0:21:45.89,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,堅持下去 總會有一天...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.98,0:21:52.60,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學 阿翼 小蝶姐 還有小空
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.81,0:21:54.28,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.42,0:21:57.80,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,以後也請多多關照
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.65,0:21:59.66,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.97,0:22:02.47,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,這本手帳...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.66,0:22:04.79,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你能再收下一次嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.21,0:22:08.46,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.88,0:22:16.85,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對要... 成為英雄！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.23,0:00:00.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.59,0:22:23.99,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Dream！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.59,0:22:23.99,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1075,970)}夢想愈衛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.74,0:22:28.32,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,和我一起做快樂的事情吧 決定了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.55,0:24:03.61,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,閃亮藥水完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.80,0:24:05.59,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,趕快回藍天大地吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.85,0:24:07.76,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,這下就能再見到爸爸和媽媽了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.05,0:24:09.00,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.26,0:24:11.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！小空 那光芒是...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.56,0:24:12.64,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.67,0:24:15.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.67,0:24:15.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海闊天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.22,0:24:18.10,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,閃耀最亮星☆ 小空的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.27,0:01:53.48,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（衝上藍天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.48,0:01:59.07,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 超越雲巔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.28,0:02:04.62,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飛吧！向著海闊天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.62,0:02:12.33,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空萬里 美麗藍天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.53,0:02:17.49,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨後初霽天空稜鏡折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.74,0:02:21.74,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,藍天的景色預告著有好事發生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.74,0:02:23.22,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（藍天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.22,0:02:27.52,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要確認一下 便伸直了雙手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.10,0:02:32.10,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名為希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.19,0:02:34.06,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速緊握！緊緊握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.19,0:02:38.65,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,戰勝絕望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.03,0:02:42.60,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我們能堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.60,0:02:45.99,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦乾眼淚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.64,0:02:45.99,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已經做好準備了嗎）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.99,0:02:48.02,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飛躍而起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.39,0:02:48.02,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(讓我們張開勇氣之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.35,0:02:53.75,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 朝氣蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.96,0:02:58.42,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把煩躁化為光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.65,0:03:03.72,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未來的圖景 充滿著可能
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.89,0:03:08.45,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,與在同一片藍天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.85,0:03:11.27,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起喚起通向明日的奇蹟！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.39,0:03:19.27,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海闊天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
